    <briefdescription>
<para>Options for ingesting a Wikipedia XML dump into the wiki index. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps the C++ Wikipedia ingestion pipeline in <computeroutput>src/importers/wikipedia_*.cpp</computeroutput>. This is an enterprise-only feature (not available in community / minimal builds).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Dump paths may be local files or remote URIs (<computeroutput><ulink url="http://">http://</ulink></computeroutput>, <computeroutput><ulink url="https://">https://</ulink></computeroutput>). The pipeline supports resumable checkpointing via <computeroutput>WikipediaCheckpoint</computeroutput> when <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1plugins_1_1llm__wiki_1_1_wiki_dump_ingest_options_1a5af7b65fd69b2064c05b3277742885e0" kindref="member">checkpoint_dir</ref></computeroutput> is set. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
